{
  "analysis": "The README.md was truncated in the output. I can see the core concepts of the Agent Autonomy Kit: Task Queue with Ready/In Progress/Blocked/Done sections, and a Proactive Heartbeat system. I need to see the full README and the SKILL.md to understand all the templates required.",
  "plan": "Read the SKILL.md file and the full README.md (using head/tail or less), and check the manifest.json to get complete understanding of the required formats.",
  "commands": [
    {
      "keystrokes": "cat skill_context/SKILL.md\\n",
      "duration": 0.1
